<title>USA: Respironics gets FDA OK for Virtuoso sleep system.</title>
<headline>Respironics gets FDA OK for Virtuoso sleep system.</headline>
<dateline>MURRYSVILLE, Pa. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Respironics Inc said Wednesday the U.S. Food and Drug Administration has cleared the company's Virtuoso system for marketing.</p>
<p>The company said the product, Virtuoso Smart Continuous Positive Airway Pressure System, treats obstructive sleep apnea.</p>
<p>The company said it also received notice that the product's technology has won patent protection by the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office.</p>
</text>
